  "prefLabel": "Plc 1306.01 Availability of Temporary License",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1306.01 Availability of Temporary License. A temporary license shall be available pursuant to RSA 328-J:13 to any individual who:\n\n(a) If applying for a limited x-ray machine operator license, has:\n\n(1) Completed the course of study required by RSA 328-J:11, I(c), as reflected in Plc 1304.01(b); and\n\n(2) Has taken an examination required by RSA 328-J:11, I(d), as reflected in Plc 1304.01(c); or\n\n(b) If applying for other than a limited x-ray machine operator license, has completed the process of applying for the certification and registration required by the applicable paragraph in RSA 328-J:11, II-X, as reflected in Plc 1304.02 through Plc 1304.10, but has not yet received certification and registration.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1300) #13701, eff 8-1-23",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1300.html"
